<title>POLAND: Ministry clears LG Group's Petrobank buy.</title>
<headline>Ministry clears LG Group's Petrobank buy.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Interior Ministry cleared Polish Petrobank SA shares for purchase by foreigners, Petrobank said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The permit paves the way for South Korea's LG Group to take a controlling stake in Petrobank.</p>
<p>South Korea's LG Securities Co Ltd, a unit of LG Group, agreed in June to buy an entire 133.5-million-zloty new share issue of Petrobank, giving it 50 percent plus one share of Petrobank's equity.</p>
<p>The issue must also be approved by the Polish Securities Commission.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
